{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_02_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_02","title":"散步時光","storyCode":"GA-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"9f6517f20f8cbc42582b59a1fef4b088e4173f566abfd8ad44dc9616d59f1b9a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快到了......塞茜莉亞，認得出附近的路了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這些房子我見過......可是，一樣的房子好多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，你是剛搬到這附近嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搬家？我不記得搬過家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，艾澤爾哥哥，媽媽帶我出門都是晚上，街上不太一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過平時，我會偷偷從窗戶看家外面的樣子......我能認出來的！我會努力的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，塞茜莉亞，會找到的，還沒到遇見你的地方呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......我在看兩邊的房子，沒有看到您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你不是早上昏倒被送醫院的小姑娘嗎？沒事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是您啊！嗯，她......她沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，之後有大人來找她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直盯到中午呢！就是沒人出現，真奇怪，父母在幹什麼呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞說，她就住在這附近，您真的沒見過她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼可愛的小姑娘，要是見過，肯定會有印象啦！我也不用在旁邊乾著急了不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，之前那個人說得有道理，我帶你們去找社區辦事處的人吧。如果是剛搬來的住戶，在辦事處肯定有登記的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，巧了，那不是葆菈姐嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葆菈姐！這邊這邊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎麼了？我趕著回辦公室呢，邊走邊說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們這片最近有新搬來的住戶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有當然是有......不過你說的最近是多近啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熱心的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_367_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，你大概什麼時候搬過來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是剛搬過來的......住在這裡很久了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？小姑娘，你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是塞茜莉亞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......沒道理呀，我在這裡工作十多年了，你要是住了很久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，你知道你的爸爸媽媽叫什麼名字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽的名字是......費莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼什麼什麼？！費莉亞，是瑟法斯街的費莉亞嗎？費莉亞不是單身嗎？怎麼突然冒出個這麼大的孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過仔細看看......你確實和費莉亞長得很像呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太奇怪了......難道是私生子？塞茜莉亞，你剛才說住了很久，是說你媽媽住在這裡很久的意思嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是來找媽媽的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，我想找媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這位小哥，那你是，費莉亞的親戚之類的？這個孩子是寄養在鄉下嗎？你帶她來看媽媽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真沒想到，難怪之前我給費莉亞介紹對象她都推辭了......原來孩子都這麼大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小哥，你怎麼不說話了？嗯？你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說著說著快走到了，那邊就是費莉亞家了，我幫你們去敲個門？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......瑟法斯街7-265號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"知性的拉特蘭市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？原來你知道地址啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，你怎麼了？你的臉色好難看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，塞茜莉亞......我們、你，先回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，回家吧，塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"名字。\n從見到塞茜莉亞就意外不斷，我甚至忘記了“我忘記問塞茜莉亞媽媽的名字”這件事。\n名字......\n生病的母親，白衣服的執行者，穿袍子的人......\n......\n我該怎麼告訴塞茜莉亞？\n我該帶她去哪裡找媽媽？\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是黎博利，為什麼要綁架一個薩科塔的女孩？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是黎博利，又為什麼要保護一個薩科塔女孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我維護的是拉特蘭的戒律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戒律？薩科塔的戒律何時真正適用於黎博利了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，你當真認為拉特蘭黎博利是拉特蘭的一員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不是？我生於斯長於斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，你知道你在說什麼嗎，帕蒂亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道，菲亞梅塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不清楚的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在拉特蘭的黎博利，自顧自地將拉特蘭戒律奉為圭臬，自顧自地將“拉特蘭教”視為信仰，自顧自地......把薩科塔視為神跡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"銃械、戒律、光環、共感......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這是薩科塔的神跡，與拉特蘭黎博利又有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎博利為何要信仰絕不會降臨於己身的神跡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的一切，拉特蘭教的一切，只屬於薩科塔，你還不明白嗎，菲亞梅塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真以為，自己成了他們的一分子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_i16"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"得手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來你也沒有那麼堅定，菲亞梅塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，菲亞梅塔，再想一想吧，我請求你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾對你說，我來自伊比利亞......你知道那是一個怎樣的地方嗎？......要我說，很多伊比利亞人比拉特蘭人更虔誠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他們得到了什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞遠在千里之外，那裡的人向拉特蘭寄託幻想......我能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是為什麼，近在咫尺的拉特蘭黎博利，也心甘情願為這群歌舞昇平的薩科塔效命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，菲亞梅塔，告訴我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說什麼都沒用，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有你的想法，帕蒂亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就告訴我啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼什麼都不說？為什麼......寧願追著明明無法企及的背影，也不願意回頭......看一眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不明白你在說什麼，帕蒂亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況，我和你說上三言兩語，就能改變你的想法嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一個人的想法是這麼隨便就能改變的東西，那我看也不值什麼錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕蒂亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_357_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你只是來拖延我的腳步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你該知道你攔不住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都有自己的工作要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓你身邊那些......和平民差不了多少的同伴，替你付代價嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會的，帕蒂亞。所以讓開吧，給我們都省點事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......到家了，塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我沒有鑰匙，開不了門......艾澤爾哥哥，你能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，你真的沒事嗎？是不是不舒服呀......從剛才開始，你的臉色就很差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事，塞茜莉亞，我來開門......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g8_laterano_dwelling"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，為什麼剛才那個姐姐說，你其實知道我家的地址......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，你認識這把銃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是，媽媽的守護銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥......媽媽的守護銃，為什麼會在你那裡......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，塞茜莉亞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要道歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有點不明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是不是知道媽媽在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，我知道......對不起，塞茜莉亞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起......我也不知道我為什麼要道歉......對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，你的媽媽，已經去世了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不在這裡，那在哪裡？“去世了”......是什麼意思......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想起來了，早上，媽媽說她要去一個地方，不能帶我一起去......是你陪她去的嗎，艾澤爾哥哥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，你能不能......也帶我去？就去一下，就待一會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不會任性的，我會聽媽媽的話，不會賴著不走......但是......但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能讓我再見一見媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒有和她說再見呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，怎麼回事？她怎麼快哭了，艾澤爾，你在欺負小姑娘嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼人？等等，這個制服......你是萬國信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有眼力嘛，艾澤爾小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奉教宗閣下的諭令，我來接塞茜莉亞前往大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":".................."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，忘了自我介紹，我的名字是奧倫·亞吉奧拉斯。如果想確認我的身份，艾澤爾小哥不妨使用一下你的公證所標準終端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我忘了，你關機了對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，你是怎麼找到這裡的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾澤爾小哥，你是不是太小看萬國信使了，你以為你的動向很難掌握嗎？或者你覺得你做事足夠周全，一路上沒有留下任何痕跡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬國信使閣下......如果你要帶走塞茜莉亞，在那之前，我能不能問你幾個問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，挺有意思的，艾澤爾小哥。你覺得我需要回答你的問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我也不是什麼壞人嘛......你問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞到底是什麼人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是什麼......天生的墮天使嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很有想像力，艾澤爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過沒有你想的那麼神秘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞是一個混血兒，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？這不可能......薩科塔的混血兒，不可能是薩科塔啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道薩科塔與他族混血的例子很少......但也沒有稀罕到要驚動教皇廳啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是很清楚原因嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔與他族的混血後裔，不會成為薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔與菲林的孩子會是菲林，薩科塔與豐蹄的孩子會是豐蹄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔混血後裔，不會在開口能言時獲得光環與光翼，也無法與薩科塔共感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡而言之，他們不會有薩科塔的特徵。無一例外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少大部分人這樣認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塞茜莉亞就是例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是不應該成為薩科塔的薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第二個問題，如果塞茜莉亞被帶到大教堂，教皇廳會怎麼......對待她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要露出那種表情，艾澤爾。如果我要哄騙你，大可以給你編點溫柔的瞎話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但正如你所見，塞茜莉亞是個“例外”。本代教宗會如何處理這一事件，我無法在此斷言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們這代的教宗閣下嘛......我不知道你對他是個什麼印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，就我個人的瞭解，他並不喜歡使用激烈的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且塞茜莉亞這麼可愛，多麼鐵石心腸的人才會傷害她呢，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......第三個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能完全信任你的回答......我希望陪同塞茜莉亞前往大教堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，這是問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很可惜，唯有這個“問題”，恕我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"奧倫，你怎麼在這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_355_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
